      "handoff": [
        "What this app does.Sketch a system, a game scene or a music workflow. Use editable examples as starting points.Draw with Excalidraw’s shapes, text, arrows, images, selection and undo.Keep an editable .excalidraw file; import a checked native scene or export PNG and SVG.Autosave in this browser, with a previous snapshot and a revision check against another tab.Make it yours. Open the independent editor and choose drawing colours and export settings. Keep an editable download before clearing browser data.Works with. Uses its own origin and browser storage. An authorised agent can work with native .excalidraw files or the same-tab window.ldraw interface. Composer does not receive the drawing; there is no MCP service.",
        "Build with this appUse LDraw’s native .excalidraw files and independent editor source. Give your agent the released source and an editable scene; browser access stays under your authorisation.Build from the native LDraw source · Open LDraw · Compare it with the shipped app library"
